# entropy-arb credentials / 密钥配置
#
#   cp .env.example .env     then fill in / 复制后填写
#
# Required to trade (the bot is live-only). Only --record-only data
# collection runs without credentials.
# 交易必填（本机器人只有实盘模式）。仅 --record-only 数据采集不需要密钥。
# NEVER commit .env / 切勿提交 .env 到 git。
#
# Credentials are keyed by VENUE (not by leg): whichever leg a venue is on,
# it reads its own block below. `lighter` reads LIGHTER_*, `lighter-rh` reads
# LIGHTER_RH_* — either deployment may be base or hedge.
# 密钥按 venue（而非按腿）配置：无论该 venue 是 base 还是 hedge 腿，都读
# 自己的区块。lighter 读 LIGHTER_*，lighter-rh 读 LIGHTER_RH_*，二者可自由
# 作为 base 或 hedge 腿。

# ===== venue: entropy — Hyperliquid =====
# ===== venue: entropy（Hyperliquid 账户） =====
# Create an API/agent wallet at https://app.hyperliquid.xyz/API — put the
# AGENT wallet's private key here and your main account address below.
# 在 https://app.hyperliquid.xyz/API 创建 API (agent) 钱包：
# 这里填 agent 钱包私钥，下面填你的主账户地址。
HL_PRIVATE_KEY=
HL_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS=

# ===== venue: tradexyz (optional overrides) =====
# tradexyz shares the Hyperliquid account above by default. To trade it from
# a separate account/agent key, set these:
# tradexyz 默认与上面共用同一 Hyperliquid 账户；如需独立账户/密钥，填写以下两项：
#HL_PRIVATE_KEY_XYZ=
#HL_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS_XYZ=

# ===== venue: lighter — Lighter mainnet =====
# ===== venue: lighter（Lighter 主网） =====
# Register an API key on the Lighter MAINNET deployment. See
# https://github.com/elliottech/lighter-python for key setup.
# 在 Lighter 主网部署上注册 API 密钥；生成方法见 lighter-python 官方仓库。
LIGHTER_ACCOUNT_INDEX=
LIGHTER_API_KEY_INDEX=
LIGHTER_API_PRIVATE_KEY=

# ===== venue: lighter-rh — Lighter Robinhood chain =====
# ===== venue: lighter-rh（Lighter Robinhood 链） =====
# Register an API key on the Lighter ROBINHOOD chain deployment. Mainnet and
# the Robinhood chain are separate accounts and separate keys — no fallback
# to the block above.
# 在 Lighter Robinhood 链部署上注册 API 密钥。主网与 Robinhood 链是两套独立
# 账户和密钥，不会回退到上面的区块。
LIGHTER_RH_ACCOUNT_INDEX=
LIGHTER_RH_API_KEY_INDEX=
LIGHTER_RH_API_PRIVATE_KEY=

# ===== lighter nonce coordination (optional) =====
# ===== Lighter nonce 协调（可选） =====
# Set ONLY when several bot processes trade the SAME Lighter account (e.g.
# several symbol pairs, or a CLI bot + `entropy-arb web` live session):
# they then share one nonce counter in Redis instead of each keeping its
# own (the default, which collides and fails with 'invalid nonce').
# docker compose deployments set this automatically (redis://redis:6379/0);
# host processes against the compose Redis use redis://localhost:6379/0.
# Leave EMPTY for the single-bot-per-account case.
# 仅当多个进程共用同一 Lighter 账户交易时设置（例如多个交易对、或 CLI 与 web
# 实盘并存）：各进程通过 Redis 共享同一 nonce 计数器，而非各自维护（默认
# 各自计数会互相冲突，报 invalid nonce）。docker compose 部署会自动设置
# （redis://redis:6379/0）；宿主机进程连 compose 里的 Redis 用
# redis://localhost:6379/0。单账户单进程时留空即可。
LIGHTER_NONCE_REDIS_URL=

# ===== venue: aster — Aster DEX V3 futures =====
# ===== venue: aster（Aster DEX V3 合约） =====
# Create a Pro API wallet at https://www.asterdex.com/en/api-wallet (switch to
# "Pro API"). The PRIVATE_KEY is the API (agent) wallet's key; the ACCOUNT
# ADDRESS is your MAIN wallet — it is part of every signature and cannot be
# derived from the API key, so BOTH are required. The account must be in
# ONE-WAY position mode (the bot refuses hedge mode at startup). Keep the
# host clock synced (NTP) — signed requests carry a microsecond nonce.
# 在 https://www.asterdex.com/en/api-wallet 创建 Pro API 钱包（顶部切换到
# "Pro API"）。PRIVATE_KEY 填 API (agent) 钱包私钥；ACCOUNT_ADDRESS 填主钱包
# 地址——它参与每笔签名且无法由 API 密钥推导，因此两项都必须填写。账户必须
# 是单向持仓模式（双向持仓会在启动时被拒绝）。请保持主机时钟同步（NTP）——
# 签名请求携带微秒级 nonce。
ASTER_PRIVATE_KEY=
ASTER_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS=

# ===== venue: polymarket — Polymarket Perps =====
# ===== venue: polymarket（Polymarket 永续合约） =====
# One-time setup (~1 week expiry): run `python tools/polymarket_make_proxy.py
# --owner-key 0x...` — it generates a fresh PROXY keypair, has your OWNER
# wallet EIP-712-sign the createProxy ceremony, and prints the three values
# below. When the credential expires, re-run the script and replace ALL THREE
# together. Trading signs with the PROXY key (never the owner key); the
# owner key never enters this file.
# 一次性准备（有效期约一周）：运行 `python tools/polymarket_make_proxy.py
# --owner-key 0x...`——脚本会新建 PROXY 钱包、用 OWNER 钱包完成 EIP-712
# createProxy 签名并打印以下三项。凭据过期后重跑脚本，三项一起替换。交易
# 签名用的是 PROXY 私钥（绝不使用 owner 私钥）；owner 私钥不写入本文件。
POLYMARKET_PROXY_ADDRESS=
POLYMARKET_PROXY_PRIVATE_KEY=
POLYMARKET_PROXY_SECRET=

# ===== venue: ondo — Ondo Perps =====
# ===== venue: ondo（Ondo 永续合约） =====
# Create an API key in the Ondo Perps app (https://app.ondoperps.xyz) with the
# `trade` scope. Both values are shown only once at creation: keep the literal
# prefixes (ondoKeyId_ / ondoApiSecret_). Requests are authenticated with an
# HMAC-SHA256 signature over timestamp + method + path + body — no wallet, no
# SDK. The host clock must be NTP-synced (requests are rejected if the
# timestamp is more than 30s off).
# 在 Ondo Perps 应用（https://app.ondoperps.xyz）创建带 `trade` 权限的 API 密钥。
# 两项值仅在创建时显示一次，请保留原始前缀（ondoKeyId_ / ondoApiSecret_）。
# 请求通过 HMAC-SHA256 签名（timestamp + method + path + body），无需钱包或 SDK。
# 请保持主机时钟同步（NTP）——时间戳偏差超过 30 秒会被拒绝。
ONDO_API_KEY_ID=
ONDO_API_SECRET=

# ===== telegram notifications (optional) =====
# ===== Telegram 通知（可选） =====
# Used by entropy_arb.notify's send() — the capability only; nothing sends
# automatically. Call notify.send("...") from your own code wherever you
# want a notification.
# 用 @BotFather 的 /newbot 创建机器人并填入其 token；chat_id 可向
# @userinfobot 发消息获取（或把 bot 拉进群后通过 getUpdates 读取）。这只是
# 通知能力：何时调用 entropy_arb.notify.send() 由你的代码决定。
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# ===== web dashboard control endpoints (optional) =====
# ===== Web 仪表盘管理端点（可选） =====
# Enables the webapp's POST control endpoints (pause / resume / flatten) —
# Bearer-token protected. Leave EMPTY (default) to keep the dashboard
# read-only. Generate one with: python -c "import secrets;
# print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
# 启用网页端的暂停/恢复/一键平仓接口（Bearer 鉴权）。留空（默认）则网页
# 保持只读。生成方式：python -c "import secrets;
# print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
ARB_WEB_TOKEN=
